    "定向进化"
  ],
  "evidence": [
    {
      "sourceId": "src-53d84edb3dabe8ae",
      "quote": "Professor Ulrich Muller Principle Investigator Uli Müller is interested in the evolution of catalytic RNAs (ribozymes).",
      "supports": [
        "identity",
        "personal_research_context"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "src-dbfcbf37f71e5279",
      "quote": "The main focus is the question ' How did Life Start? '",
      "supports": [
        "personal_research_context"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "src-dbfcbf37f71e5279",
      "quote": "combining RNA biochemistry (catalytic RNAs and their selection, evolution, characterization)",
      "supports": [
        "personal_research_context"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "src-dbfcbf37f71e5279",
      "quote": "We are also interested in developing therapeutic ribozymes based on self-splicing group I intron ribozymes.",
      "supports": [
        "research",
        "topics"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "src-dbfcbf37f71e5279",
      "quote": "we have developed directed evolution strategies",
      "supports": [
        "methods"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "src-dbfcbf37f71e5279",
      "quote": "We re-design them into trans-splicing ribozymes that can remove and/or replace RNA fragments on substrate RNAs, and thereby re-program them for treatments of diseases.",
      "supports": [
        "research",
        "topics"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "src-dbfcbf37f71e5279",
      "quote": "We hope that the near future will see ribozyme-based RNA splicing as a useful approach for clinical applications.",
      "supports": [
        "source_limitations"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "src-dbfcbf37f71e5279",
      "quote": "To do that, we have developed directed evolution strategies that improved different sequences on the ribozymes.",
      "supports": [
        "research",
        "methods"
      ]
    }
  ],
